      "updated": 1789213430033,
      "created": 1789192635506,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Define what is a success in plan step\nSearch on web\nPlan -> Steps \nEach step -> Multiple LLM actions before success\nWhat is current action desc of LLM\nWhat is current plan step executing\nYou can call multiple tools at same time\nActions can be added dynamically\nStore imp info in recent_info and memory\n- if current plan step complete\n  then proceed to next step\n  else continue current plan\n- if all steps complete \n  then final output",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Define what is a success in plan step\nSearch on web\nPlan -> Steps \nEach step -> Multiple LLM actions before success\nWhat is current action desc of LLM\nWhat is current plan step executing\nYou can call multiple tools at same time\nActions can be added dynamically\nStore imp info in recent_info and memory\n- if current plan step complete\n  then proceed to next step\n  else continue current plan\n- if all steps complete \n  then final output",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
